      "This product supports scheduled payout-state, but V1 requires a manual payout assumption. No payout schedule is seeded by default.",
      "This product supports distribution-paying fund elections. V1 seeds reinvest by default; cash payout requires a manual annual distribution-yield assumption, and payouts below the published minimum annual cash-payout amount of $40 remain reinvested.",
